abstract: >-
  Research artifact for a chance-corrected test of mutant-real-fault coupling.
  The primary question is whether a fault-triggering test satisfies the
  historical unique-kill coupling criterion more often than a coverage-matched
  ordinary non-triggering test on the same kill matrices. No coupling estimates
  are archived yet. This repository is the intended GitHub source for a future
  Zenodo software deposit. No DOI is assigned yet.
